  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">System-based Audit RWI                            (Raoul Wallenberg Institute)</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Systemrevision RWI                                (Raoul Wallenberg Institutet)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">PLEASE REVIEW YOUR ANSWER AS THE QUESTION HAS BEEN CHANGED

Detta &#xe4;r ett beslut om att genomf&#xf6;ra en systembaserad revision av Raoul Wallenberg-institutet (RWI), i enlighet med de f&#xf6;rfaranden som f&#xf6;reskrivs i avtalet med allm&#xe4;nna villkor mellan Sida och RWI f&#xf6;r perioden 2013-2017. System-revisionen kommer att genomf&#xf6;ras under februari-mars 2014, och rapporten presenteras f&#xf6;r Sida och RWI i Lund i mars.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This is a decision to carry out a system-based audit of the Raoul Wallenberg Institute (RWI), in accordance with the procedures laid down in the Agreement with General Conditions between Sida and RWI for the period 2013-2017. The system-based audit will be performed during February-March 2014, and the report presented to Sida and RWI in Lund in March.</narrative>
  </description>
